message: "If you use this repository, its datasets, 3D models, evaluation results or methodology, please cite this work and its associated research article."
title: "Barcelona 1929 AI–3D Reconstruction"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-10-09

authors:
  - family-names: "Pàmies"
    given-names: "Carles"
    affiliation: "Escola Tècnica Superior d'Arquitectura de Barcelona (ETSAB), Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya (UPC)"

abstract: >
  Research repository accompanying the study
  "Reconstructing the Barcelona Exhibition of 1929 through
  AI-Based Generative 3D Reconstruction". The repository
  documents a comparative evaluation of four image-to-3D
  generative AI systems applied to three vanished pavilions
  of the 1929 International Exposition of Barcelona.

keywords:
  - "digital heritage"
  - "generative artificial intelligence"
  - "3D reconstruction"
  - "architectural heritage"
  - "Barcelona 1929"
  - "image-to-3D"
  - "cultural heritage"
  - "virtual reconstruction"
  - "museography"

